Scope

This license covers the code written for the Fire Fight port, from 2026 onwards: the build
system, the port layer (source/compat), the port's own source files, its changes to the
original sources as far as they can be told apart from them, the tests and the tools.

It does not cover the original Fire Fight (1996): its source code, data and soundtrack are
copyright 1996 Chaos Works, Electronic Arts and Epic MegaGames, and come with no license.
They are kept here to preserve the game; see README.md.

